WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
This is AgentVisor AI: the control plane for AI agents that touch real money and real systems.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
Companies let AI agents order stock and pay invoices on their own. One tricked agent can send thousands to a fake vendor.

00:13.000 --> 00:21.000
AgentVisor sits between the agent and the money. Bad orders are blocked before they go out, and proven afterwards. Here is the complete flow, from zero.

00:21.000 --> 00:26.000
A brand new user lands on AgentVisor AI.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
They create a workspace. Company, email, password. That is the whole setup.

00:32.000 --> 00:38.000
A brand new workspace. Zero sessions, zero deployments. Nothing to audit, yet.

00:38.000 --> 00:47.000
One install command connects their first daemon. AgentVisor issues its signing key automatically.

00:47.000 --> 00:56.000
And the first sessions stream in. Their buying agent just tried to pay a vendor that is not on the approved list. The order is blocked: $8,400 kept.

00:56.000 --> 01:03.000
One click isolates the blocked session.

01:03.000 --> 01:13.000
Inside it: the agent was tricked into ordering from an unapproved vendor. Blocked before the money moved. Its retry, with the approved vendor, went through.

01:13.000 --> 01:19.000
Share a verification link, or copy the raw receipt. One click each.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.000
The receipt downloads in one click.

01:22.000 --> 01:28.000
Drop it into the public verifier. Green tick. No account.

01:28.000 --> 01:36.000
Starter policies come enabled on day one. Plain rules, enforced before the money moves.

01:36.000 --> 01:42.000
A command palette jumps anywhere. Light or dark, your call.

01:42.000 --> 01:48.000
Each deployment gets its own signing key and ingest token.

01:48.000 --> 02:04.000
Members, API keys, single sign-on, webhooks, audit log, billing. Everything an admin needs is self-serve, from the very first day. That is day one: from an empty workspace to a signed, verifiable audit trail.

02:04.000 --> 02:10.000
AI agents you can hand to an auditor. agentvisorai.me
